<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>For You</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Georgia', 'Times New Roman', serif;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #1a0f14 0%, #2b1620 45%, #1a0f14 100%);
    color: #f7e9e5;
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }
  .wrap { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 22px 80px; }

  /* HERO */
  #hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    padding: 40px 24px;
  }
  #hero::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, rgba(214,120,140,0.18), transparent 60%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow {
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #d99cae;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
  }
  .hero-title {
    font-size: 34px;
    line-height: 1.35;
    margin-bottom: 26px;
    font-weight: normal;
  }
  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #cfa9b3;
    margin-bottom: 44px;
    max-width: 420px;
  }
  button.open-btn {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid #d99cae;
    color: #f7e9e5;
    padding: 14px 34px;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border-radius: 30px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all .35s ease;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
  }
  button.open-btn:hover { background: #d99cae; color: #2b1620; }

  .heart-loader {
    font-size: 22px;
    margin-top: 30px;
    opacity: .55;
    animation: pulse 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulse { 0%,100% { opacity: .3; transform: scale(1);} 50% {opacity:.8; transform: scale(1.12);} }

  #story { display: none; }
  #story.shown { display: block; animation: fadeIn 1.1s ease; }
  @keyframes fadeIn { from {opacity:0; transform: translateY(14px);} to {opacity:1; transform: translateY(0);} }

  .section {
    padding: 70px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(217,156,174,0.15);
  }
  .section:last-of-type { border-bottom: none; }
  .eyebrow {
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #d99cae;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: normal;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  p {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: #ecd9d5;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .highlight { color: #f2b6c4; font-style: italic; }

  .photo {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin: 26px 0;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
    display: block;
  }
  .photo-pair {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 26px 0;
  }
  .photo-pair img { width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }

  .tap-card {
    border: 1px solid rgba(217,156,174,0.35);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 26px 22px;
    margin: 26px 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background .3s ease;
    position: relative;
  }
  .tap-card:hover { background: rgba(217,156,174,0.06); }
  .tap-card .prompt {
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #d99cae;
  }
  .tap-card .revealed {
    display: none;
    margin-top: 18px;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .tap-card.open .revealed { display: block; animation: fadeIn .6s ease; }
  .tap-card.open .prompt { display: none; }

  .stat-box {
    background: rgba(217,156,174,0.08);
    border-left: 3px solid #d99cae;
    padding: 20px 22px;
    margin: 22px 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .stat-box strong { color: #f2b6c4; }

  .carousel {
    overflow: hidden;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 24px 0;
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 6%, black 94%, transparent);
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 6%, black 94%, transparent);
  }
  .carousel-track {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    width: max-content;
    animation: carousel-scroll 32s linear infinite;
  }
  .carousel:hover .carousel-track { animation-play-state: paused; }
  .carousel-track img {
    height: 230px;
    width: auto;
    border-radius: 6px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  @keyframes carousel-scroll {
    from { transform: translateX(0); }
    to { transform: translateX(-50%); }
  }

  .closing {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 90px 0 40px;
  }
  .closing h2 { font-size: 30px; margin-bottom: 26px; }
  .better-half {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #f2b6c4;
    margin: 30px 0;
  }
  .song-box {
    margin-top: 40px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .song-caption {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #cfa9b3;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .signature {
    margin-top: 50px;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #ecd9d5;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="hero">
  <div class="hero-eyebrow">for you</div>
  <div class="hero-title">Remember our first date?</div>
  <div class="hero-sub">I was so excited and nervous. I stopped by Best Buy just to make sure I looked my best for you.</div>
  <button class="open-btn" onclick="openStory()">open this</button>
  <div class="heart-loader">♡</div>
</div>

<div id="story">
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="section">
      <div class="eyebrow">where it started</div>
      <h2>Our first date</h2>
      <p>Walking through the FIT museum, holding your hand, I felt this tingly feeling I couldn't shake. Leaving you that day, all I wanted was to see you again. I couldn't wait for the rest of the week.</p>
      <div class="photo-pair">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="us">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="us">
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <div class="eyebrow">seven years</div>
      <h2>The mark we just hit</h2>
      <p>We just crossed year seven. There's actually a name for this exact stretch.</p>

      <div class="tap-card" onclick="this.classList.toggle('open')">
        <div class="prompt">tap to see why year seven matters</div>
        <div class="revealed">
          <p>Psychologists call it the <span class="highlight">"seven-year itch,"</span> a term for the restlessness or dissatisfaction that tends to show up in relationships right around this point. It's not just a saying either: divorce rates in first marriages tend to spike around year seven or eight, often tied to communication breaking down, unmet expectations, and the everyday weight of just living life together.</p>
          <p>So statistically, a lot of couples don't make it past exactly where we are right now. But here's the other side of that same research: relationships can come out of this stretch <span class="highlight">stronger</span> when both people commit to actually doing the work. That's the choice I'm making.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="photo-pair">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="us">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="us">
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <div class="eyebrow">august 31, 2020</div>
      <h2>One of my favorite memories</h2>
      <p>You told me we were going swimming, and that I'd be the one teaching you how to swim. But you surprised me with a spa date instead. We ended up eating lunch on a rooftop, just talking and laughing, having one of the best times we've had together. We closed out the night with an intimate moment, just the two of us.</p>
      <p>I love you for planning something so thoughtful, for putting that much care into a day just for me.</p>
      <img class="photo" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="us">
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <div class="eyebrow">i hear you</div>
      <h2>This has not been easy</h2>
      <p>I know it hasn't. I'm not going to pretend otherwise. I know you're exhausted. I know you haven't been at peace. I know our communication hasn't been what it should be, and I know you've felt emotionally checked out. I see all of it. And I hear you. Really hear you. And I still believe the two of us can find our way back to easy again: back to love, back to peace, back to being better partners for each other.</p>
      <img class="photo" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="us">
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <div class="eyebrow">not perfect</div>
      <h2>But willing to do the work</h2>
      <p>I'm not perfect. I'm not going to stand here and act like I've got this all figured out. But I am willing to put in the work to get us through this phase, if you're willing to not give up on us either.</p>

      <div class="tap-card" onclick="this.classList.toggle('open')">
        <div class="prompt">tap to keep going</div>
        <div class="revealed">
          <p>Before I ever choose to walk away, I'm choosing to fight for us. Every single time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <div class="eyebrow">a few of us</div>
      <div class="carousel">
      <div class="carousel-track">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="us">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="us">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="us">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="us">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="us">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="us">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="us">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="us">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="us">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="us">
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="closing">
      <div class="eyebrow">before you go</div>
      <h2>You are my better half.</h2>
      <div class="better-half">Always be my baby. That's not just the song playing below.<br>That's the promise.</div>

      <div class="song-box">
        <iframe style="border-radius:12px" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/track/2aBxt229cbLDOvtL7Xbb9x?utm_source=generator&theme=0" width="100%" height="152" frameBorder="0" allowfullscreen="" allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" loading="lazy"></iframe>
      </div>
      <div class="song-caption">always be my baby — mariah carey</div>

      <div class="signature">I love you. No matter what we're going through.</div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<script>
function openStory() {
  document.getElementById('hero').style.display = 'none';
  const story = document.getElementById('story');
  story.classList.add('shown');
  story.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'});
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
